# superpowers:brainstorming writes design specs here and its checklist says to commit them.
# Committing one trips tests/docs/test_doc_drift.py (the register must map 1:1 to tracked
# markdown). Keep specs untracked — _tracked_markdown() shells to `git ls-files`, so untracked
# is invisible to every doc-drift check. Do not "fix" this by adding the path to EXEMPT_PREFIXES.
docs/superpowers/
